-- Group isomorphisms f : G ≃* H and automorphisms: inverses and composites
-- of isomorphisms, isomorphism as an equivalence between groups, transfer
-- of commutativity, and conjugation as an inner automorphism
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
